      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}E(X+Y) &amp;= \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} (x+y)f(x,y) dxdy = 8 \\int_{0}^{1} dx \\int_{x}^{1} xy(x+y) dy = \\frac{8}{15} + \\frac{4}{5} = \\frac{4}{3}\\,, \\\\E[(X+Y)^2] &amp;= E(X^2 + 2XY + Y^2) = \\int_{0}^{1} dx \\int_{x}^{1} 8xy(x^2 + 2xy + y^2) dy = \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{8}{9} + \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{17}{9}\\,, \\\\D(X+Y) &amp;= E[(X+Y)^2] - E^2(X+Y) = \\frac{17}{9} - \\left( \\frac{4}{3} \\right)^2 = \\frac{1}{9}\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}E(X+Y) &amp;= \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} (x+y)f(x,y) dxdy = 8 \\int_{0}^{1} dx \\int_{x}^{1} xy(x+y) dy = \\frac{8}{15} + \\frac{4}{5} = \\frac{4}{3}\\,, \\\\E[(X+Y)^2] &amp;= E(X^2 + 2XY + Y^2) = \\int_{0}^{1} dx \\int_{x}^{1} 8xy(x^2 + 2xy + y^2) dy = \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{8}{9} + \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{17}{9}\\,, \\\\D(X+Y) &amp;= E[(X+Y)^2] - E^2(X+Y) = \\frac{17}{9} - \\left( \\frac{4}{3} \\right)^2 = \\frac{1}{9}\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
