      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{三角形区域}G \\text{如图所示},\\ G\\text{的面积为}1/2,\\ \\text{所以}(X,Y)\\text{的联合概率密度为}\\\\f(x,y)=\\begin{cases}2,\\ \\ (x,y)\\in G\\\\0,\\ \\ (x,y)\\in G\\end{cases}.\\\\E(X+Y)=\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}(x+y)f(x,y)dx dy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{1-x}^{2}(x+y)dy\\\\=\\int_{0}^{1}(x^{2}+2x)dx=\\left.\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}+x^{2}\\right)\\right|_{0}^{1}=\\frac{4}{3}.\\\\E[(X+Y)^{2}]=\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}(x+y)^{2}f(x,y)dx dy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{1-x}^{2}(x+y)^{2}dy\\\\=\\frac{2}{3}\\int_{0}^{1}(x^{3}+3x^{2}+3x)dx=\\frac{11}{6}\\\\ \\text{所以}\\qquad D(X+Y)=E[(X+Y)^{2}]-[E(X+Y)^{2}]=\\frac{1}{18}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{三角形区域}G \\text{如图所示},\\ G\\text{的面积为}1/2,\\ \\text{所以}(X,Y)\\text{的联合概率密度为}\\\\f(x,y)=\\begin{cases}2,\\ \\ (x,y)\\in G\\\\0,\\ \\ (x,y)\\in G\\end{cases}.\\\\E(X+Y)=\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}(x+y)f(x,y)dx dy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{1-x}^{2}(x+y)dy\\\\=\\int_{0}^{1}(x^{2}+2x)dx=\\left.\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}+x^{2}\\right)\\right|_{0}^{1}=\\frac{4}{3}.\\\\E[(X+Y)^{2}]=\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-x}^{+\\infty}(x+y)^{2}f(x,y)dx dy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{1-x}^{2}(x+y)^{2}dy\\\\=\\frac{2}{3}\\int_{0}^{1}(x^{3}+3x^{2}+3x)dx=\\frac{11}{6}\\\\ \\text{所以}\\qquad D(X+Y)=E[(X+Y)^{2}]-[E(X+Y)^{2}]=\\frac{1}{18}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
