      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}X_{i}(i=1,2,\\cdots,n) \\text{的分布函数为} \\\\F(x)=\\begin{cases}1-e^{-x},\\; x&gt;0 \\\\0,\\quad\\text{其它}\\end{cases},\\\\Z=\\min\\{X_{1},X_{2},\\;\\cdots,X_{n}\\} \\text{的分布函数为} \\\\F_{z}(z)=1-[1-F(z)]^{n}=\\begin{cases}1-e^{-nz},\\; z&gt;0 \\\\0,\\quad\\text{其它}\\end{cases}, \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}X_{i}(i=1,2,\\cdots,n) \\text{的分布函数为} \\\\F(x)=\\begin{cases}1-e^{-x},\\; x&gt;0 \\\\0,\\quad\\text{其它}\\end{cases},\\\\Z=\\min\\{X_{1},X_{2},\\;\\cdots,X_{n}\\} \\text{的分布函数为} \\\\F_{z}(z)=1-[1-F(z)]^{n}=\\begin{cases}1-e^{-nz},\\; z&gt;0 \\\\0,\\quad\\text{其它}\\end{cases}, \\end{aligned}</div>\n<span class=\"latex-text\">于是，</span>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} E(Z)&amp;=\\int_{0}^{z} zne^{-z}dz=-ze^{-nz}|_{0}^{z}+e^{-nz}dz=\\frac{1}{n},\\\\ E(Z^{\\prime})&amp;=\\int_{0}^{z} z^{2}ne^{-nz}dz=\\frac{2}{n^{2}}, \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} E(Z)&amp;=\\int_{0}^{z} zne^{-z}dz=-ze^{-nz}|_{0}^{z}+e^{-nz}dz=\\frac{1}{n},\\\\ E(Z^{\\prime})&amp;=\\int_{0}^{z} z^{2}ne^{-nz}dz=\\frac{2}{n^{2}}, \\end{aligned}</div>\n<span class=\"latex-text\">于是，</span>\n<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"D(Z)=E(Z^{\\prime})-(E(Z))=\\frac{1}{n^{3}}.\">D(Z)=E(Z^{\\prime})-(E(Z))=\\frac{1}{n^{3}}.</span>"
